---@field ResourceId aws.route53resolver.ResourceId The ID of the virtual private cloud (VPC) that you're updating the DNSSEC validation status for.
---@field Validation aws.route53resolver.Validation|string The new value that you are specifying for DNSSEC validation for the VPC. The value can be ENABLE or DISABLE. Be aware that it can take time for a validation status change to be completed.

---@class aws.route53resolver.UpdateResolverDnssecConfigResponse
